      "writtenOn": "2021-04-29T20:29:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think for CompOS, it\u0027s more flexible to be agnostic to the exact command line, especially since we can\u0027t add arbitrary arguments to the API, or new/optional fields in a parcelable (or can we?).  It\u0027ll be definitely a great idea once everything has settled, then ART team can co-own this interface when they need to add/remove/redefine dex2oat flags.",
      "parentUuid": "5e8441a9_326c3b0e",
